@startuml
' Figure 2.5  Permission lifecycle
' Reading order: left to right from requested to spent or ended.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
hide empty description
[*] --> Requested
Requested --> Granted : Policy allows
Requested --> Denied : Policy refuses
Granted --> Spent : One execution
Granted --> Expired : Time runs out
Granted --> Revoked : Risk revokes
Spent --> [*]
Denied --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]
@enduml
